      <Step>
      <strong>Read the title and the metadata</strong>
      <ul>
      <li>The DOCTYPE is <code>-//OASIS//DTD DITA BookMap//EN</code> with <code>bookmap.dtd</code>. A bookmap is a map, so everything from Part 2 still applies inside it.</li>
